CSSLift Privacy Policy
Last updated: October 27, 2026

CSSLift is a browser extension that shows and copies the CSS of elements on web pages you choose to inspect.

Data we collect: none. CSSLift does not collect, store, sell or share any personal data, browsing history or website content.

How it works: CSSLift runs only on the tab where you start it, by clicking its icon or pressing its shortcut. It reads that page's styles inside your browser. Code you copy goes only to your clipboard.

Settings: your preferences are saved in your browser's local storage and never leave your device.

Pro licenses: if you buy CSSLift Pro, payment is handled by Lemon Squeezy, which receives your email and payment details under its own privacy policy. CSSLift sends only your license key to Lemon Squeezy to check that it is valid, and stores the key locally in your browser.

